{"unit_id":"mathangler__dsh-opencode-session-header#card-zh","repo":"mathangler/dsh-opencode-session-header","commit":"7cda9def67d8d9c79bb61ba697c664c6d5e1788e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-opencode-session-header**（DSH 模型插件）：为 opencode-go 开头的路由添加按会话区分的 x-opencode-session 请求头。插件在模型请求交给 pi-ai 前复制选项并补入会话标识，支持 auto、uuid、id 三种值模式，也可让无会话标识的辅助调用继承发起会话。状态端点展示挂接情况和诊断信息，卸载时会恢复钩子。适合使用 OpenCode Go 网关的 DSH 用户，无需额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:115-178","lib/session-header.js:268-303","lib/session-header.js:515-559"]}
